Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,One versus All
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Weslie rallied the morale of Team Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi gave it his all to score points for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighting spirit of the little goats drove Vera into a frenzy, making her play recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, the two teams were tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy and Victor finally arrived at the court…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of performance will they put on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time for apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s still half the game left to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up: tactical deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, you’ve worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy will be taking your place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Paddi; leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some good rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you all to listen carefully to what I’m about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve all made it this far while facing criticism and doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pushing forward even when no one believed in you—it hasn’t been easy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But not only have you persevered,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ve shown everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that ordinary steps can complete a magnificent journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing on this grand final stage right now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is the ultimate validation of your hard work, trust, unity,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and refusal to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For this final match, I want you all to remember:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,believe in yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of you is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave no regrets—go out there and truly enjoy the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From this second on, it’s your moment to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Time-out is over; athletes, please return to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The real match is finally beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy of Team Defenders has shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Which team will take the championship?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Team Defenders, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an imposing presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor scores the moment he steps onto the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His exceptional individual skill is truly incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s completely…completely impossible to defend against.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor’s moves might look simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but every ounce of energy is used with precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He achieves the ultimate state of offense and defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,An absolutely incredible play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One versus all, totally unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,—a god descended to earth—that’s the only way to describe Victor. —Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Daddy will definitely win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor is even more formidable than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, your leg…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor’s strength lies in his individual ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s not impossible to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor has the ball again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders has switched to double-teaming Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of double-team relies heavily on chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they’ve found a way to counter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Team Defenders finally halted Victor’s offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Scored—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They scored!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor, whose individual skills had been unstoppable throughout the games
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and who had never failed before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,has actually been defeated by the collective team play of Team Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Being the best doesn’t guarantee a win,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and solo talent never beats a team with one heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! That’s amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go win back the points we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Teamwork…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let’s score another basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d like to ask everyone a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you prefer basketball where you play one-on-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,or basketball that involves teamwork and passing the ball to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to choose one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think team-oriented basketball is better; it makes winning easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And it’s also…more fun…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think team basketball is great, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might want to try focusing a bit more on working with the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the atmosphere within the team would be better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our team will become an unstoppable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor receives the pass and breaks through on his own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing this, Team Defenders immediately moves to surround him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But as expected, Victor still chooses to attack solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie blocks Victor’s attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I…don’t want to lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I’ve believed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that only by becoming a king with exceptional individual skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,can one stand tall on this court forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don’t beat everyone else on the court, it’s completely meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,On my own—even if I stood at the very pinnacle of the game—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I still wouldn’t be able to see what lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t just me alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe I could see further.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Score the basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,—Victor’s assist leads to a basket for Team Wolves.　—Victor actually passed the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s win the championship together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
